{
  "name": "巨量跳空 回档买进",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [595, 596, 597],
  "source": "巨量跳空，回档买进，强调在低迷市道下或形态合适时，如果个股突然跳空并放出巨量，说明主力意图明确，回档就是买入机会。原文还特别强调：回档最好缩量、不回补跳空缺口，且之后要再次放量上攻。",
  "source_summary": "若出现巨量跳空上攻，随后浅回档且缩量、不补缺口，则可视为回档买点。",
  "comment": "当前提取的是日线版‘巨量跳空 + 次日缩量浅回档仍守住缺口’。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["open", "high", "low", "close", "volume"],
  "warmup_bars": 60,
  "indicator_type": "volume_price_rule",
  "params": {
    "volume_ma_window": 10,
    "gap_volume_multiplier": 2,
    "shrink_volume_ratio": 0.8,
    "signal_keep_days": 3
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "volume_ma",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": "$params.volume_ma_window",
      "description": "10日均量"
    },
    {
      "id": "gap_volume_threshold",
      "op": "mul",
      "field": "volume_ma",
      "field2": "$params.gap_volume_multiplier",
      "window": 0,
      "description": "两倍10日均量"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev2_high",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "high",
      "window": 2,
      "description": "前两日最高价"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_high",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "high",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日最高价"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_low",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "low",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日最低价"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_open",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "open",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日开盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_close_prev2",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 2,
      "description": "前两日收盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_close",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日收盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_volume",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日成交量"
    },
    {
      "id": "prev_volume_ma",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "volume_ma",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日10日均量"
    },
    {
      "id": "shrink_volume_threshold",
      "op": "mul",
      "field": "prev_volume",
      "field2": "$params.shrink_volume_ratio",
      "window": 0,
      "description": "回档缩量阈值"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "prev_open",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "prev2_high"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "prev_low",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "prev2_high"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "prev_volume",
            "operator": ">=",
            "right": "prev_volume_ma"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "prev_volume",
            "operator": ">=",
            "right": "gap_volume_threshold"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "low",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "prev_high"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "volume",
            "operator": "<=",
            "right": "shrink_volume_threshold"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "close",
            "operator": ">=",
            "right": "prev_high"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "prev_close",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "prev_close_prev2"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "先识别前一日是否为巨量跳空上攻日。",
    "再检查当前交易日是否只是浅回档，且最低价没有回补前一日跳空缺口。",
    "要求回档日量能较跳空日明显缩小，且收盘仍守在缺口上沿之上。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以前一日巨量跳空后，次日缩量浅回档但不补缺口的交易日作为回档买进信号日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文还会结合新股、弱市背景和后续再放量上攻，当前主规则先保留最核心的回档买点判断。",
    "shrink_volume_ratio=0.8 是当前默认建议，后续可按回测结果调整。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "这里把‘回档买进’压成了‘跳空后的次日/近几日浅回档确认’。",
    "warmup_bars >= max(volume_ma_window + 2, signal_keep_days + 2)"
  ],
  "explain": "该规则用于识别巨量跳空之后，缩量浅回档且不补缺口的短线承接买点。"
}
